<h2>3.3. Statistical Pairwise Evaluation (DeLong Test)</h2>
<p>To rigorously determine if the observed differences in AUC-ROC were statistically significant, we employed the non-parametric DeLong test for correlated ROC curves (<strong>Table 3</strong>). SwinUNETR-LP demonstrated a statistically significant superiority over SegFormer3D-MSCA (ΔAUC = -0.254, Z = -2.609, <em>p</em> = 0.009). Although SwinUNETR-LP also outperformed MAE-TinyTransformer3D (ΔAUC = -0.079) and Attention-SwinUNETR (ΔAUC = -0.111), these margins did not reach statistical significance (<em>p</em> &gt; 0.05), which is mathematically consistent given the inherently limited sample size (N=37) of the external test cohort.</p>
